"16.188" end="16.301">tle</span><span begin="16.301" end="16.626">men</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">女士们先生们</span></p><p begin="17.165" end="17.839" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="17.165" end="17.273">I</span> <span begin="17.273" end="17.505">told</span> <span begin="17.505" end="17.839">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我跟你们说过</span></p><p begin="18.360" end="20.643" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="18.360" end="18.654">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="18.654" end="18.931">&quot;中</span><span begin="18.931" end="19.258">国&quot;,</span> <span begin="19.710" end="20.003">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="20.003" end="20.226">&quot;中</span><span begin="20.226" end="20.643">国&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这是“中国”，这是“中国”</span></p><p begin="21.106" end="24.303" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="21.106" end="21.434">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="21.434" end="21.761">&quot;中</span><span begin="21.761" end="22.214">国&quot;,</span> <span begin="22.290" end="22.416">no</span> <span begin="22.416" end="22.542">more</span> <span begin="22.542" end="22.782">&quot;Chi</span><span begin="22.782" end="23.212">na&quot;,</span> <span begin="23.212" end="23.530">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="23.530" end="23.830">&quot;中</span><span begin="23.830" end="24.303">国&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这是“中国”，别再说“China”，这是“中国”</span></p><p begin="24.846" end="27.352" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="24.846" end="25.039">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="25.039" end="25.251">&quot;中</span><span begin="25.251" end="25.484">国&quot;</span> <span begin="25.484" end="25.585">充</span><span begin="25.585" end="25.700">满</span><span begin="25.700" end="25.813">能</span><span begin="25.813" end="25.989">量</span> <span begin="25.989" end="26.251">使</span><span begin="26.251" end="26.303">我</span><span begin="26.303" end="26.477">能</span><span begin="26.477" end="26.568">够</span><span begin="26.568" end="26.802">飞</span><span begin="26.802" end="27.352">翔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这是“中国” 充满能量 使我能够飞翔</span></p><p begin="27.976" end="30.854" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="27.976" end="28.113">I</span> <span begin="28.113" end="28.399">can</span> <span begin="28.399" end="28.894">fly,</span> <span begin="28.894" end="29.231">yeah,</span> <span begin="29.231" end="29.516">I</span> <span begin="29.516" end="29.743">can</span> <span begin="29.743" end="30.854">fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我能飞，耶，我能飞</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="30.195" end="31.658"><span begin="30.195" end="30.362">(我</span><span begin="30.362" end="30.494">能</span><span begin="30.494" end="31.658">飞)</span></span></p><p begin="31.289" end="34.340" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="31.289" end="31.514">Will</span> <span begin="31.514" end="31.842">you</span> <span begin="31.842" end="32.395">be</span><span begin="32.395" end="32.824">lieve</span> <span begin="32.824" end="32.934">you</span> <span begin="32.934" end="34.340">can?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你会相信你能吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="33.716" end="35.122"><span begin="33.716" end="33.944">(你</span><span begin="33.944" end="34.014">是</span><span begin="34.014" end="34.158">中</span><span begin="34.158" end="34.257">国</span><span begin="34.257" end="34.480">人</span><span begin="34.480" end="35.122">吗)</span></span></p><p begin="34.815" end="37.871" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="34.815" end="35.052">I</span> <span begin="35.052" end="36.328">can,</span> <span begin="36.328" end="36.514">I</span> <span begin="36.514" end="36.727">can</span> <span begin="36.727" end="37.871">fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我能，我能飞</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="37.209" end="38.668"><span begin="37.209" end="37.322">(我</span><span begin="37.322" end="37.511">能</span><span begin="37.511" end="38.668">飞)</span></span></p><p begin="38.315" end="41.804" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="38.315" end="38.530">Will</span> <span begin="38.530" end="38.971">you</span> <span begin="38.971" end="39.356">be</span><span begin="39.356" end="39.815">lieve</span> <span begin="39.815" end="40.250">you</span> <span begin="40.250" end="41.804">can?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你会相信你能吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="40.548" end="42.016"><span begin="40.548" end="40.679">(是</span><span begin="40.679" end="40.815">中</span><span begin="40.815" end="40.926">国</span><span begin="40.926" end="41.019">人</span><span begin="41.019" end="41.252">就</span><span begin="41.252" end="41.367">可</span><span begin="41.367" end="42.016">以)</span></span></p><p begin="41.900" end="42.579" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.900" end="42.579">Yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">耶</span></p><p begin="42.867" end="48.166" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.867" end="43.017">中</span><span begin="43.017" end="43.303">国</span><span begin="43.303" end="43.452">人</span><span begin="43.452" end="43.677">能</span><span begin="43.677" end="44.640">飞</span> <span begin="44.640" end="44.887">中</span><span begin="44.887" end="45.064">国</span><span begin="45.064" end="45.303">人</span><span begin="45.303" end="45.413">能</span><span begin="45.413" end="46.367">飞</span> <span begin="46.367" end="46.623">中</span><span begin="46.623" end="46.816">国</span><span begin="46.816" end="47.051">人</span><span begin="47.051" end="47.175">能</span><span begin="47.175" end="48.166">飞</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="48.373" end="49.044"><span begin="48.373" end="48.493">(揽</span><span begin="48.493" end="49.044">佬)</span></span></p><p begin="49.813" end="55.161" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.813" end="50.086">黄</span><span begin="50.086" end="50.254">皮</span><span begin="50.254" end="50.450">肤</span><span begin="50.450" end="50.764">才</span><span begin="50.764" end="51.549">对</span> <span begin="51.549" end="51.771">讲</span><span begin="51.771" end="51.987">中</span><span